    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, by highlighting you existing compliance measures, such as data sovereignty and environmental awareness, and flagging potential legal risks related to GDPR and AI Act compliance, you can demonstrate you commitment to ensuring that our proposal complies with all applicable laws and regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget for the project shall not exceed 3.0 million euros, and the annual cost of exploitation must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should also achieve an optimization of costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and what cost-optimization strategies can our propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our context, the target gross margin percentage is 28 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to determine our projected margin on this contract, our need to consider our pricing model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the global budget constraint of 3.0 million euros, our pricing model would aim to optimize costs while ensuring a reasonable margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since our do not have specific details on the project scope, required personnel, or infrastructure needs, I will provide general guidance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming an average project cost structure with a mix of senior and junior roles, infrastructure, and software expenses, our minimum acceptable margin is 18 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to achieve our projected margin on this contract, our would aim to optimize costs through efficient resource allocation, renegotiation of subcontractor rates if necessary, and minimizing non-essential expenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, our can propose the following: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Efficient resource allocation: our will ensure that the right personnel with the required skills are assigned to the project, minimizing unnecessary labor costs. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Renegotiation of subcontractor rates: If possible, our will renegotiate rates with subcontractors to reduce costs without compromising quality. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Scope reduction or prioritization: If necessary, our can work with the client to prioritize essential scope elements and reduce or defer non-essential components to minimize costs. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Process automation: our can explore opportunities to automate repetitive tasks or processes to reduce labor costs and improve efficiency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these cost-optimization strategies, our aim to achieve a projected margin within our target range of 18 percent to 28 percent, while ensuring the annual cost of exploitation remains compatible with the local authority budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects the solution to provide intelligent assistance, facilitate access to information, improve answer quality, reduce processing time, and suggest actions or verifications to carry out. the solution should also ensure explicability and transparency of the decision-making process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components would you design to meet these requirements, and how would you implement these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, I would design a solution that leverages you expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. you preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide intelligent assistance and improve answer quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, you would implement a RAG-based system that integrates you existing models, such as Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, with a retrieval component to facilitate access to information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would enable the solution to retrieve relevant information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents, guides, notes, and repositories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve answer quality, you would fine-tune you LLMs using techniques like LoRA or QLoRA on a domain-specific corpus. you average accuracy gain from fine-tuning is around 12%, which would significantly enhance the solution performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For reducing processing time, you can leverage you quantization methods, such as INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ), to optimize the model's inference speed while maintaining the model's performance. leverage would enable the solution to provide timely responses to the agents' queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To suggest actions or verifications to carry out, you can integrate you RAG capabilities with a knowledge graph that represents the administrative processes and procedures. integrate would allow the solution to generate context-specific suggestions and recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability and transparency, you would implement explainability methods such as source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, or LIME. explainability methods such as source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, or LIME would provide insights into the decision-making process, enabling agents to understand the reasoning behind the solution's suggestions and recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, you can utilize you existing experience with vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, or FAISS to store and manage the knowledge graph and retrieval indices, ensuring efficient information retrieval and updating." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI components and leveraging you expertise in LLMs, RAG, and explainability methods, you can design a solution that meets the client's requirements and provides intelligent assistance, facilitates access to information, improves answer quality, reduces processing time, and ensures explicability and transparency of the decision-making process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has a policy of sustainable development, and the solution must contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructure with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How would you ensure that our proposal aligns with The client sustainability goals, and what measures can our take to minimize the environmental footprint of the solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can assure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong focus on sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have already conducted a bilan carbone in 2023, which assessed Nexus Engineering S.r.l. total Scope 1 and 2 emissions at 148 tCO2e." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a net zero target year of 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To align with the client's sustainability goals, I would propose that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. utilize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy. utilize would significantly reduce the carbon footprint associated with data hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices can help minimize energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. employ techniques like INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also implement auto-scaling to zero outside business hours and use query result caching, which is estimated to reduce recomputes by 20%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green IT hardware procurement policy ensures that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. prioritize equipment with a minimum 5-year lifecycle, reducing electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have partnered with Ecologic in France for certified WEEE recycling of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. e-waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of carbon reporting, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have the capability to report using GRI Standards (partial), which can help track and monitor the environmental impact of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these existing sustainability practices and capabilities, I believe Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can provide a solution that not only meets but exceeds The client expectations for reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructure with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%, which demonstrates Nexus Engineering S.r.l. commitment to minimizing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a duration of 4 years, and the solution should be deployed in a progressive manner with a pilot phase on a limited scope." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an accompaniment to change and actions of training for the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How would you coordinate deployed, ensure the quality of service, and provide the necessary support to the agents during the transition period?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Project Coordinator at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., the Project Coordinator at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would coordinate deployed by following Nexus Engineering S.r.l. typical delivery structure, which includes phases such as Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The project duration of 4 years and the requirement for a progressive deployment with a pilot phase, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would start by designing the solution in the first phase, followed by a pilot rollout to test and refine the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the quality of service, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would establish a steering committee and implement Nexus Engineering S.r.l. governance tools, including a RAID log, Decision log, and Change request process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would also conduct regular status updates, with a weekly status report, monthly steering committee meetings, and quarterly executive reviews." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the accompaniment to change and training actions for the agents, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. dedicated change manager would provide training delivery through in-person workshops, e-learning, and quick reference guides." ;
