    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The intelligent assistance tool will accompany agents in agents administrative activities, assisting with tasks such as searching for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, drafting letters or answers to users, and suggesting actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval integrates with existing practices of agents and does not constitute a rupture in agents modes of work. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval achieves contextualization of answers in function of the demand of the agent, proposes help with the drafting of administrative contents, such as answers to users, administrative letters, and syntheses of files, and recalls applicable rules. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval also suggests actions or verifications to carry out and facilitates the continuity of the processing of files between agents and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium proposed technical architecture uses AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, data engineering, and cybersecurity. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval leverages large language models, retrieval-augmented generation, and explainability methods to provide intelligent assistance and improve answer quality. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval reduces processing time and provides transparent and interpretable results. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval is deployed on cloud infrastructure using OVHCloud, Scaleway, Outscale, SecNumCloud, or Azure EU regions, with a deployment strategy that includes Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), Helm, and API gateways such as Kong, Apigee, or AWS API Gateway. an artificial intelligence-based assistance system designed to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users in the City of Belval complies with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensures data sovereignty by hosting data in EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

