    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, civil status, town planning, EDM, user directories, and API, our will utilize our expertise in API standards like REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS. our will also use API gateways such as Kong, Apigee, or AWS API Gateway to manage and secure the APIs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For monitoring and optimization of costs, our will employ Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack to monitor the system's performance and response times. our experience with Terraform and Ansible will be used for infrastructure-as-code (IaC) management and automation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee quality of service and achieve a high level of availability, our will implement security design patterns such as Zero-trust, VLAN segmentation, and mTLS between services. our will also use encryption methods like AES-256 at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit to protect the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

